#: CRM/Ses/ConnectionTest.php
msgid ""
"Amazon SES rejected these credentials (%1). No email will send until they "
"are corrected. Check that the secret is the IAM secret access key, not an "
"SES SMTP password."
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses/ConnectionTest.php
msgid "SES credentials rejected"
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses/ConnectionTest.php
msgid "Could not reach Amazon SES to check these credentials: %1"
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses/ConnectionTest.php
msgid "SES not reachable"
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses/ConnectionTest.php
msgid ""
"Amazon SES accepted these credentials. Permission to send cannot be verified"
" without sending an email."
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses/ConnectionTest.php
msgid "SES credentials verified"
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses/ConnectionTest.php
msgid ""
"Suppression list removal is enabled, but this IAM policy does not allow "
"ses:DeleteSuppressedDestination. Taking a contact off hold will leave them "
"suppressed at Amazon SES and their mail will still be dropped, without any "
"error. Add the permission or turn the option off."
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses/ConnectionTest.php
msgid "SES permission missing"
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses/ConnectionTest.php
msgid ""
"Could not determine whether this IAM policy allows "
"ses:DeleteSuppressedDestination: %1"
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses/ConnectionTest.php
msgid "SES permission unknown"
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses.php
msgid "Ses Transactional Emails (do not delete)"
msgstr "Amazon SES işlemsel e-postaları (silmeyin)"

#: CRM/Ses.php
msgid "SES Access Key must be a string."
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses.php
msgid ""
"SES Access Key has leading or trailing whitespace. Re-paste it without the "
"surrounding space or newline."
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses.php
msgid "SES Secret Key must be a string."
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses.php
msgid ""
"SES Secret Key has leading or trailing whitespace. Re-paste it without the "
"surrounding space or newline."
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses.php
msgid ""
"This looks like an SES SMTP password rather than an IAM secret access key. "
"The SES API needs the secret access key from IAM; SMTP credentials only work"
" over SMTP."
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses.php
msgid ""
"SES Secret Key contains HTML-escaped characters (such as \"&#43;\" in place "
"of \"+\"). Re-paste it directly from AWS."
msgstr ""

#: CRM/Ses.php
msgid ""
"SES Secret Key looks percent-encoded (an escape sequence beginning with "
"\"%\" in place of \"+\" or \"/\"). Re-paste it directly from AWS."
msgstr ""

#: managed/Mailprotocol.mgd.php
msgid "SES"
msgstr "SES"

#: managed/Navigation.mgd.php
msgid "Amazon SES"
msgstr "Amazon SES"

#: settings/ses.setting.php
msgid "SES Access Key"
msgstr "SES erişim anahtarı"

#: settings/ses.setting.php
msgid "The IAM Access Key ID, typically 20 characters beginning \"AKIA\"."
msgstr ""

#: settings/ses.setting.php
msgid "SES Secret Key"
msgstr "SES gizli anahtarı"

#: settings/ses.setting.php
msgid ""
"The IAM Secret Access Key, typically 40 characters. Not the SES SMTP "
"password - that only works over SMTP, not for the API."
msgstr ""

#: settings/ses.setting.php
msgid "SES Region"
msgstr "SES bölgesi"

#: settings/ses.setting.php
msgid ""
"Must be the one setup on your account. Ex: ca-central-1, us-east-1, etc."
msgstr ""
"Hesabınızda ayarlanmış olan olmalıdır. Örneğin: ca-central-1, us-east-1, vb."

#: settings/ses.setting.php
msgid "Remove from SES suppression list on un-hold"
msgstr "Beklemeden kaldırıldığında SES bastırma listesinden kaldırılsın"

#: settings/ses.setting.php
msgid ""
"When enabled, taking a contact's email address off hold in CiviCRM will call"
" the Amazon SES DeleteSuppressedDestination API to remove it from your SES "
"account-level suppression list. Requires the ses:DeleteSuppressedDestination"
" IAM permission to be granted to the configured IAM user, in addition to the"
" existing sending permission."
msgstr ""
"Etkinleştirildiğinde, CiviCRM üzerinde bir kişinin e-posta adresini "
"beklemeden çıkarmak, SES hesap düzeyinde bastırma listenizden kaldırmak için"
" Amazon SES DeleteSuppressedDestination API uygulamasını çağırır. Var olan "
"gönderme iznine ek olarak, yapılandırılmış IAM kullanıcısına "
"ses:DeleteSuppressedDestination IAM izninin verilmesi gerekir."

#: settings/ses.setting.php
msgid "SNS Topic ARN (optional)"
msgstr "SNS Topic ARN (isteğe bağlı)"

#: settings/ses.setting.php
msgid ""
"If set, the bounce/complaint webhook only accepts SNS notifications whose "
"TopicArn matches this exact value (e.g. arn:aws:sns:us-"
"east-1:123456789012:my-topic). Recommended: it stops anyone from replaying "
"validly-signed notifications published from a different SNS topic to your "
"public webhook. Leave blank to accept any topic (previous behaviour)."
msgstr ""
"Ayarlanırsa, geri dönüş/şikayet internet kancası yalnızca, TopicArn için bu "
"tam değerle eşleşen SNS bildirimlerini kabul eder (arn:aws:sns:us-"
"east-1:123456789012:my-topic gibi). Öneri: Herkesin farklı bir SNS "
"konusundan yayınlanan geçerli imzalanmış bildirimleri herkese açık internet "
"kancanıza yeniden göndermesini engeller. Herhangi bir konunun (önceki "
"davranış) kabul edilmesi için boş bırakın."
